      "content": "i just want to rest. not like a nap or a weekend away, but like... real rest. the kind where you don't have to wake up and face the weight of it all again tomorrow. everything is just so loud and so much. do you think it's even possible to ever truly feel quiet again? or is this just how it is now?",
